{"id":"4e01ee20e163d443","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-pa.md","title":"Peano 算术的公理集","display":"df-pa — Peano 算术的公理集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-pa","aliases":["20-df-pa"],"display":"df-pa — Peano 算术的公理集","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§10.1 PA；本地公理展开","source_pdf_pages":[215],"source_printed_pages":[183],"depends_on":["[[20-df-formula]]","[[20-df-provable]]","[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-pa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-pa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pa — Peano 算术的公理集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§10.1 PA；本地公理展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea674d0eb2839a85\" href=\"?note=ea674d0eb2839a85\" title=\"20-df-provable\">20-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8372bbf882660759\" href=\"?note=8372bbf882660759\" title=\"20-df-classical-proof-system\">20-df-classical-proof-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{PA}=\\{0,S,+,\\times\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{PA}=\\{0,S,+,\\times\\}\\)</span>，元数分别为 0,1,2,2；固定经典一阶带等号证明系统 P；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi(x,\\vec z)\">\\(\\phi(x,\\vec z)\\)</span> 为该语言公式。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ea674d0eb2839a85\" href=\"?note=ea674d0eb2839a85\" title=\"20-df-provable\">20-df-provable</a>。</p>\n<p>本目录所用固定证明系统为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_H\">\\(P_H\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8372bbf882660759\" href=\"?note=8372bbf882660759\" title=\"20-df-classical-proof-system\">20-df-classical-proof-system</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}:=\\{\n\\forall x\\ Sx\\ne0,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ (Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ x+0=x,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ x\\times0=0,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ x\\times Sy=(x\\times y)+x\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{UC}((\\phi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x(\\phi\\to\\phi[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\phi):\n\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_{PA}),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\\\\nPA:=\\{\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA}):\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}\\vdash_P\\theta\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}:=\\{\n\\forall x\\ Sx\\ne0,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ (Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ x+0=x,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ x\\times0=0,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ x\\times Sy=(x\\times y)+x\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{UC}((\\phi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x(\\phi\\to\\phi[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\phi):\n\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_{PA}),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\\\\nPA:=\\{\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA}):\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}\\vdash_P\\theta\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Sent 是 df-formula 中无自由变量的公式子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 可定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists z(x+Sz=y)\">\\(\\exists z(x+Sz=y)\\)</span>；原书使用含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;,0,1,+,\\cdot\">\\(&lt;,0,1,+,\\cdot\\)</span> 的计算等价语言。归纳模式统一全称化全部参数，代入避免变量捕获。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1 PA；本地公理展开；印刷页 183；PDF 第 215 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"ea674d0eb2839a85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-classical-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"8372bbf882660759","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-provable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"ea674d0eb2839a85","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-provable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-classical-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"8372bbf882660759","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{PA}=\\{0,S,+,\\times\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi(x,\\vec z)","display":false},{"tex":"P_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}:=\\{\n\\forall x\\ Sx\\ne0,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ (Sx=Sy\\to x=y),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ x+0=x,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\\\\n\\forall x\\ x\\times0=0,\\quad\n\\forall x,y\\ x\\times Sy=(x\\times y)+x\\}\\\\\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{UC}((\\phi[0/x]\\land\n\\forall x(\\phi\\to\\phi[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\phi):\n\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_{PA}),\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\},\\\\\nPA:=\\{\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA}):\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}\\vdash_P\\theta\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists z(x+Sz=y)","display":false},{"tex":"<,0,1,+,\\cdot","display":false}],"bytes":1719,"backlinks":[{"id":"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。"},{"id":"379df91db6a6f0af","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。"},{"id":"96aa7c2f3c33ea30","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-pa]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-pa]] — 章 10；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-pa]]"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"重点入口：编码与模型 [[20-df-strings]]、[[20-df-tmcomp]]、[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；对象与接口 [[20-df-tred]]、[[20-df-characteristic]]、[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；逻辑 [[20-df-formula]]、[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]、[[20-df-pa]]；树与构造 [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]、[[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；博弈 [[20-df-gale-stewart]]、[[20-df-bm-strategy]]；良基递归 [[20-df-kleene-O]]、[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]。"}],"outgoing":["0c35680c0004f5e2","ea674d0eb2839a85","8372bbf882660759"]}